WEBVTT

00:01:58.935 --> 00:02:02.255
e transformou-se numa coluna
que escrevia para o New York Times,

00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:04.602
chamada "Life, Interrupted".

00:02:04.734 --> 00:02:05.635
(Aplausos)

00:02:05.659 --> 00:02:06.691
Obrigada.

00:02:06.735 --> 00:02:08.555
(Aplausos)

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:11.700
Mas sobretudo,

00:02:11.914 --> 00:02:15.432
concentrava-me em sobreviver.

00:02:15.863 --> 00:02:18.460
E - alerta de "spoiler" -

00:02:18.514 --> 00:02:20.489
(Risos)

00:02:20.633 --> 00:02:22.701
sobrevivi, sim.

00:02:22.785 --> 00:02:25.945
(Aplausos)

00:02:27.899 --> 00:02:30.884
Graças a um exército
de seres humanos solidários,